# Central Coast

Read `.cursor/skills/central-coast/SKILL.md` and its coverage file before drafting.

- Stay inside the `central-coast` corridor.
- Research a fact before writing it. Unknown fees and hours stay “Check on arrival”.
- Put season news in `season`, not in `intro`.
- Write `seoTitle` and `seoDescription` only on types that already have those fields.
- Do not change existing dots.
- Run `npm run check:content` and show the diff. The owner publishes.
